            "notes": "During the first round, get [Lille F\u00e6lde](item_d92c59ae-b2f5-48e5-9f60-66144441eee8) which allows you for a quick Bola Shot while during the air after every Updraft. But the quick Bola Shots from Lille F\u00e6lde has its downsides. Such as:\n- Bola from Lille F\u00e6lde slow is decreased by 60%.\n- Radius is reduced by 25%.\n- Bola Shot no longer pulls\n\nBut even though this is an [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) build, taking things for [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) such as:\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n\nare critical during the first round.",
