            "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:17:09.753428+00:00",
            "notes": "During this round, buying [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) and [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) are very important for survival. This is true because [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) gives extra overhealth per ability used. [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) also gives overhealth when using Updraft. The effects of both items can be combined to get more overhealth from using abilities as [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) also resets Quick Dash per Updraft use. \n\n[Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is just good in general for Freja as she uses Quick Dash frequently during every teamfight. \n\n---\nTogether, Freja becomes harder to kill while in the air which leads to a slightly more aggressive playstyle.",
