            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-11T01:17:10.158461+00:00",
            "notes": "Taking [So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) combo's very well with the other power [Lille F\u00e6lde](item_d92c59ae-b2f5-48e5-9f60-66144441eee8). [So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) provides buffs towards the Bola Shots in a wide variety of ways. \n\n[So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) improves Bola Shot's by dealing 30% more damage. It also releases a AOE field that damages enemies for 3 seconds. Not only that, all Bola Shot kills now contribute towards Bounty Hunting which is a passive that only Freja has. \n\nWith the AOE field, the item [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) becomes much more powerful as it also slows whoever comes in the field of damage. Which in this case can contribute to more damage to the people in the field and also is vital to Ultimate Charge. \n\n---\n\nBounty hunting is a passive that after three eliminations, gain 25% (around 440 points). If Freja reaches 3 stacks when her ultimate ability is already available, the refund is stored and Freja gains the bonus charge after using her ultimate. More than one refund cannot be stored.",
